Third-party parts

GeoHand began from HoloHand (https://github.com/IbaadGEO/HoloHand-Gesture-Agent-3D),
which is based on Tuba Khan's HoloHand-Gesture-Agent-3D
(https://github.com/tubakhxn/HoloHand-Gesture-Agent-3D). Code that came from
those projects remains under the MIT License in LICENSE-HoloHand; that licence
applies to those parts only. Bundled libraries (three.js, MediaPipe Tasks Vision,
Upstash Redis client and the Manrope font) keep their own licences.
